nginx-mod-brix-cache (2.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Debian/Ubuntu packaging of BriX-Cache 2.0.0, the first release distributed
    as .deb packages.  Full release notes live in CHANGELOG.md; the
    authoritative package changelog is the RPM spec's %changelog
    (packaging/rpm/nginx-mod-brix-cache.spec).  This file is a fallback for
    direct dpkg-buildpackage runs — packaging/deb/build-deb.sh regenerates it
    with the version derived from src/core/ident.h (BRIX_SERVER_VERSION_BARE)
    and the target Ubuntu codename.
  * Breaking on upgrade: brix_pss_dca and brix_backend_passthrough_persist are
    removed (nginx -t: unknown directive); observability compatibility aliases
    are removed (see CHANGELOG.md v2.0.0 "Breaking").

 -- Rob Currie <rob.currie@ed.ac.uk>  Sat, 05 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000

